    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features and Functions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Ultra-realistic VHS video simulation for an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A wide variety of collectible items covering all aspects of childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 3 complete, themed levels, with ongoing expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Support for the latest technologies, including Lumen, Nanite, and DLSS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/11756717c52dd61b7d187303a6627b6f.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this Chinese dreamcore exploration game, where you can momentarily escape the bustling present and drift into the hazy memories of the 2000s, collecting fragments of times gone by...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/da9017adfefc15ecfd6064f5033b1284.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Road Home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything here feels so familiar, as if returning to your childhood home. Yet simultaneously, something seems strangely alien. Suddenly, you realize that no one is here anymore...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/4d3216a58e6ca9ac5359c38c267745cd.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Empty Pedestrian Street</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's as if you've returned to that evening, visiting the underground market with your parents, filled with the humid scent of fabrics. But now only the lonely mannequins guard this forgotten corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/c176e65c44d1e58138dc94584e8f9c47.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to School</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's as if you've returned to that early morning, sunlight pouring into the classroom through dusty windows. The blackboard still bears messy chalk writings and blurred doodles, but now only empty desks and chairs silently await students who will never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/e49a07afd0fc4814b5712022472e3bfa.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Promised Future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translucent blue interfaces float in midair like an unfinished dream. Smooth curves, blurry gradients, floating bubbles\u2014this is the future promised in millennium-era advertisements: clean, sterile, perfect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/530319cdcaf5c893cd172f2423425054.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features and Functions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Ultra-realistic VHS video simulation for an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A wide variety of collectible items covering all aspects of childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 3 complete, themed levels, with ongoing expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Support for the latest technologies, including Lumen, Nanite, and DLSS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/11756717c52dd61b7d187303a6627b6f.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this Chinese dreamcore exploration game, where you can momentarily escape the bustling present and drift into the hazy memories of the 2000s, collecting fragments of times gone by...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/da9017adfefc15ecfd6064f5033b1284.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Road Home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything here feels so familiar, as if returning to your childhood home. Yet simultaneously, something seems strangely alien. Suddenly, you realize that no one is here anymore...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/4d3216a58e6ca9ac5359c38c267745cd.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Empty Pedestrian Street</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's as if you've returned to that evening, visiting the underground market with your parents, filled with the humid scent of fabrics. But now only the lonely mannequins guard this forgotten corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/c176e65c44d1e58138dc94584e8f9c47.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to School</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's as if you've returned to that early morning, sunlight pouring into the classroom through dusty windows. The blackboard still bears messy chalk writings and blurred doodles, but now only empty desks and chairs silently await students who will never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/e49a07afd0fc4814b5712022472e3bfa.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Promised Future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translucent blue interfaces float in midair like an unfinished dream. Smooth curves, blurry gradients, floating bubbles\u2014this is the future promised in millennium-era advertisements: clean, sterile, perfect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/530319cdcaf5c893cd172f2423425054.avif?t=1754889401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Wander through spaces constructed from millennial memories, experiencing the fusion of Chinese dreamcore and liminal space aesthetics. Use your camera to capture corners forgotten by memory, collect fragments of childhood. No monsters or jumpscares, immerse yourself fully in this millennial dream.",
